STAEformer architecture provenance

This directory implements the architecture described by Liu et al.,
"Spatio-Temporal Adaptive Embedding Makes Vanilla Transformer SOTA for Traffic
Forecasting" (CIKM 2023), using the authors' public implementation as the
structural reference:

  https://github.com/XDZhelheim/STAEformer
  commit fc49d39b2f1a8e3cf37b6289d7240680e1690f3f
  model/STAEformer.py and model/STAEformer.yaml

The upstream repository did not contain a license file at the recorded commit.
This project implementation was written for the local model interface and keeps
the source and adaptation boundaries explicit.
